      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "xor：成对交换并相加\nmask = 4 → 2 → 1\n\n本例终态：\n[36,36,36,36,36,36,36,36]\n\n所有 lane 都持有全和",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "xor：成对交换并相加\nmask = 4 → 2 → 1\n\n本例终态：\n[36,36,36,36,36,36,36,36]\n\n所有 lane 都持有全和",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
