      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "down 满足 reduce-to-one；xor 满足 warp 内 all-reduce。用途不同，不能断言谁总更快。",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "down 满足 reduce-to-one；xor 满足 warp 内 all-reduce。用途不同，不能断言谁总更快。",
